# Generated build OUTPUT, produced by the release pipeline (.github/workflows/
# build-wiki.yml) and committed only because the repository is their delivery
# channel — deploy/autoupdate.sh pulls src/launcher.html on a timer, the
# Dockerfile COPYs it, and the Tauri bundle embeds it. Locally built copies are
# for testing and must never be committed. See "GENERATED ARTIFACTS ARE CI-ONLY"
# in agents.md.
#
# `linguist-generated` is what makes GitHub label these "Generated" and collapse
# them in a diff instead of rendering megabytes of minified bundle.
#
# Deliberately NO `* text=auto` or eol rules in this file: the repo carries CRLF
# in places (see the line-endings note in agents.md), so a blanket
# normalization here would rewrite line endings repo-wide.
src/launcher.html linguist-generated=true
src/lithic.html linguist-generated=true
variants/*.html linguist-generated=true
